    "detailed_description": "Idle Industries is a project developed solely by me(Max Tarabbia). Its a factory building sim with several idle game mechanics including a prestige system and offline time resimulation. Start by using miners to get a good base of resources. From there the tutorial will guide you through using belts to transport resources and refineries. Refined materials will have a higher value and are necessary to construct more advanced buildings. After a few dozen hours you'll begin to approach 1 million credits which will then allow you to prestige and start again but this time resources are twice as valuable!<br><br>This game features completely original music, and approximately 5 hours of gameplay...but this is an idle game so its all depends on how its played.<br><br>Options include a few anti-aliasing options, Key maps for basic controls, volume sliders and unlockable skins!<br><br>This game is open source as well!<br><br>Check out the code on ",
